Error [E0114]: When `value >= 0` is false, `digit` reaches the end without a value
  --> total_guard_missing_value.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     if value >= 0 -> return value
    |     ^^
 Why: A block that promises Int Never! must end with a value of that type, or leave through `return` on every path
 Fix: Add a last line that produces Int Never! for that case, or turn the last guard into an `else`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0114
